* Main Information *

Title                   : Snowlines
Filename                : snowlines.lvlx
Release date            : 2026.01.19(20)
Author                  : SkullGamer205
Author Info 		: https://skullgamer205.neocities.org

Description             : The first level is in the style of Adventure of Demo
                          (the successor/fan asset pack based on A Second X Thing).
                          The level is stylized with a winter/snowy mountain theme.
                          This level also features new mechanics specific to re-
                          cent versions of TheXTech (specifically 1.3.7.2 and above).

Additional Credits	: Textures:: Prox's NEW GFX Pack
                                     [https://www.smbxgame.com/forums/viewtopic.php?p=404880]

                                     YI Beautiful Snowfall Effect
                                     [https://wohlsoft.ru/forum/viewtopic.php?f=10&t=550]

                                     SMB3-Style Cooligan (by Diegohx99)
                                     [https://smbxarchive.wohlsoft.ru/SMBX%20Assets%20Archive/
                                     Level%20Assets/NPCs/SMBX%201.3.0.1/Rex/SMB3/
                                     Cooligan%20-%20Diegohx99/]

                                     Big Onion
                                     [from: A2XT Episode 1]

			  Music::    Dracula X - Bloodline (D_MM2_13.mid)
                                     [https://www.smwcentral.net/?p=section&a=details&id=21404]

                          SFX::      Wind SFX
                                     [from: Knytt Stories]

